          "content": "#### Raw Logs\n\nInspect the last 1,000 raw log entries within your selected time window. Use the time picker to choose any range up to 31 days. When arriving from a drilldown link, the originating dashboard's time range is applied automatically. Use the **Filters** variable above to narrow results by any column.",
